        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n** VIRTUAL TOUR AVAILABLE BY REQUEST **\n\nMySherryFitz Online Portal -> To view current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Gleeson are delighted to present No. 5 Kyle Terrace, Kickham Street, Thurles to the market; an extended 2-Bed townhouse, centrally located within minutes' walk of Thurles town centre and offering excellent potential for refurbishment and modernisation.\n\nWith a highly convenient location, a sunny South-facing rear and accommodation extending to approx. 744 Sq.Ft / 69.2 Sq.M, this property presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a town residence to renovate and finish to their own tastes and requirements.\n\nLOCATION\n\nKyle Terrace is situated on Kickham Street, within a short walk of Thurles town centre and an extensive range of shops, services and amenities.\n\nEly's Centra and Aldi are immediately adjacent, while Thurles Shopping Centre / Dunnes Stores, Lidl and the wider town centre are all within easy walking distance. The property is also conveniently located to local primary and secondary schools and MIC Thurles Campus.\n\nThurles Railway Station provides regular intercity services to Dublin, Cork and Limerick, while the M8 Motorway is easily accessible at either Two-Mile Borris or Horse & Jockey.\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\nNo. 5 comprises an extended two-storey townhouse which now requires refurbishment and modernisation throughout, offering an ideal opportunity for a purchaser to upgrade the property and create a comfortable home in this highly convenient town location.\n\nAccommodation is well laid out over two floors and includes Entrance Hall, Sittingroom, a spacious Kitchen / Dining / Livingroom, Rear Hall and Bathroom on the Ground Floor. Upstairs contains a Landing and 2 no. Bedrooms. Central Heating is provided by an Oil-Fired system and all mains services are connected.\n\nTo the rear is a sunny South-facing yard / patio area with Garden Shed, together with pedestrian access via a shared rear lane.\n\nAREA\n\nTotal Floor Area: Approx. 744 Sq.Ft / 69.2 Sq.M.\n\nSUMMARY\n\nGiven its excellent central location and clear scope for improvement, No. 5 Kyle Terrace represents an attractive opportunity for a variety of purchasers, whether seeking a home within easy walking distance of Thurles town centre or a property with refurbishment and investment potential.\n\nVIEWINGS / VIRTUAL TOUR\n\nA virtual tour link can be supplied on request, with in-person viewings strictly by appointment only. Further enquiries can be made by contacting Sole Selling Agents, Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson in Thurles - (0504) 22997.\n\n_______________________________\n\nThese particulars are issued by Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson on the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract and are provided for guidance purposes only. While every effort has been made to ensure accuracy, no liability is accepted for any errors or omissions. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information provided, through inspection or other means. The vendor does not make or give, and neither Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson nor any of its employees has authority to make or give, any representation or warranty in respect of this property. Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson is marketing this property on the basis that all relevant title and certification documents are in place or will be provided by the vendor prior to sale.\n_______________________________"
      },
